cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SAFE-Gate: Safety-First Gated Triage with Conservative Risk Merging"
abstract: >-
  A six-gate triage ensemble whose conservative merging rule keeps every critical
  patient at a critical tier with zero false discharges and zero broken safety
  invariants. The repository contains the reference implementation, a
  deterministic seed-42 driver that regenerates every reported metric to
  committed CSVs, and the figure generators.
